Eilebrin Observatory is one of a handful of observatories across [[Geography/Calaria/index|Calaria]] that do not answer to [[Org/Belvedere/index|Belvedere]]. It studies the nebula that the [[Divinity/Outer Gods/Watcher With 1,000 Eyes|Watcher]] set in the sky.

[[People/Benny|Benny]] has worked there advising the bodyguards of the observatory's staff.
